{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 86,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        68.93421936035156,
        136.2740936279297,
        85.31422424316406
      ],
      "text": "Feasibility",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        95.56519317626953,
        527.0248413085938,
        108.71018981933594
      ],
      "text": "The interview study produced no data on the use of LF-LAM in children living with HIV. In",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        111.06519317626953,
        526.98095703125,
        124.21018981933594
      ],
      "text": "younger and sicker children, urine sample collection is more cumbersome, as it requires both",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        126.56519317626953,
        526.9634399414062,
        139.71018981933594
      ],
      "text": "the child’s and the caregiver’s cooperation, and it may be affected by medical issues, such as",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        142.065185546875,
        249.21800231933594,
        155.21018981933594
      ],
      "text": "dehydration (see  ). Web Annex B.10",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        166.069091796875,
        527.0635375976562,
        179.21409606933594
      ],
      "text": "Important feasibility challenges are related to the deteriorating quality of the stool sample",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.569091796875,
        527.23388671875,
        194.71409606933594
      ],
      "text": "caused by delays between time of collection and time of processing in the laboratory (see",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        197.069091796875,
        163.98040771484375,
        210.21409606933594
      ],
      "text": "). Web Annex B.10",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        221.0731201171875,
        526.9458618164062,
        234.21812438964844
      ],
      "text": "Concurrent testing needs to be framed as a more efficient way of working (i.e. testing two",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        236.5731201171875,
        526.9478759765625,
        249.71812438964844
      ],
      "text": "samples concurrently during the same visit, instead of testing one sample during each of two",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        252.0731201171875,
        527.0030517578125,
        265.2181396484375
      ],
      "text": "separate visits) that also allows increasing access and reducing costs for patients. According",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        267.5731201171875,
        526.9654541015625,
        280.7181396484375
      ],
      "text": "to a laboratory manager, this framing of the benefits outweighing the additional workload,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        283.0731201171875,
        526.9369506835938,
        296.2181396484375
      ],
      "text": "and potentially resulting in reduced work in the long run, will be critical to avoid concurrent",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        298.5731201171875,
        526.9589233398438,
        311.7181396484375
      ],
      "text": "testing being perceived as additional work for already overburdened health care workers (see",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        314.0731201171875,
        163.98040771484375,
        327.2181396484375
      ],
      "text": "). Web Annex B.10",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        338.0769958496094,
        526.9959716796875,
        351.2220153808594
      ],
      "text": "Prior investments made in frontrunner technologies, donor preferences, limited health systems",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.972515106201172,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        353.5769958496094,
        526.9479370117188,
        366.7220153808594
      ],
      "text": "thinking and unnecessary competition between manufacturers all pose challenges to policy",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        369.0769958496094,
        527.1150512695312,
        382.2220153808594
      ],
      "text": "adoption and implementation of novel molecular diagnostics. In addition, national in-country",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.998700141906738,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        384.5769958496094,
        526.6863403320312,
        397.7220153808594
      ],
      "text": "health technology and cost-efficacy assessments can delay decisions to implement newer",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        400.0769958496094,
        493.9747009277344,
        413.2220153808594
      ],
      "text": "technologies and diagnostic strategies using different samples (see  ). Web Annex B.10",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        425.588623046875,
        275.1541442871094,
        441.9685974121094
      ],
